---

<footer class="mt-20 border-t border-[var(--color-line)]">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1180px] px-5 py-10 sm:px-8 sm:py-12">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between">
      <div>
        <p class="font-display text-3xl font-extrabold text-[var(--color-bone)]">AYTO<span class="text-[var(--color-match-hi)]">.</span>matches</p>
        <p class="mt-2 max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-bone-dim)]">
          Zahlen statt Bauchgefühl für <span class="font-display italic">Are You The One? Deutschland</span>.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-1.5 text-sm text-[var(--color-bone-mut)] md:text-right">
        <p>Unabhängige Fan-Seite · nicht offiziell von RTL</p>
        <p>Daten können sich ändern</p>
        <p class="pt-1">
          <a href="https://github.com/nbgit10/ayto_solver" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
             class="font-medium text-[var(--color-match-hi)] transition-colors hover:text-[var(--color-her)]">Mehr zum Solver →</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 flex items-center gap-3 border-t border-[var(--color-line)] pt-5">
      <span class="font-mono text-[0.62rem] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[var(--color-bone-mut)]">geringe Chance</span>
      <span class="h-2 min-w-0 flex-1 rounded-full"
            style="background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2a2435,#3a5fb0,#7b3fd6,#b73cff,#ff6fae)"></span>
      <span class="font-mono text-[0.62rem] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[var(--color-bone-mut)]">hohe Chance</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
